# Load order:
# - AddonIsActive.lua comes first: every file except the texts calls ns.AddonIsActive() when it loads.
# - Locales\enUS.lua comes next: it creates the texts table (ns.L), which files read when they load.
# - The other languages follow enUS.lua and replace the texts they translate.
# - Core.lua comes last: it connects the other files and starts the addon.
# - All other files only use each other from inside functions, so their order doesn't matter.
AddonIsActive.lua

Locales\enUS.lua
Locales\deDE.lua
Locales\frFR.lua
Locales\esES.lua

